 "name_en": "Restricted Party Screening with SAP Watch List Screening (1WE)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Restricted Party Screening with SAP Watch List Screening (1WE)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioffea8b522f5f46ffa29d11c79c81c866\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioffea8b522f5f46ffa29d11c79c81c866__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Perform sanctioned party list screening of business partners and relevant documents, such as sales orders and deliveries, as part of international trade compliance.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables screening items against the organization's denied party list utilizing SAP Watch List Screening. Self-service configuration allows organizations to define applicable regulations.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This is a nonstandard scope item that is activated for customers wishing to utilize the functionality and owning a license for SAP Watch List Screening.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioffea8b522f5f46ffa29d11c79c81c866__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage legal regulations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Activate documents for screening</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Activate company code checks</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioffea8b522f5f46ffa29d11c79c81c866__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Support compliance of international trade</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Keep international trade processes frictionless</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Avoid financial loss</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用 SAP Watch List Screening 的受限制方审查 (1WE)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioffea8b522f5f46ffa29d11c79c81c866\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioffea8b522f5f46ffa29d11c79c81c866__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">作为国际贸易合规性的一部分，对业务伙伴和相关凭证（如销售订单和交货）执行制裁对象清单审查。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持使用 SAP Watch List Screening 根据组织的已拒绝相关方清单审查项目。自助服务配置允许组织定义适用的法规。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">这是一个非标准范围项目，为希望使用该功能并拥有 SAP Watch List Screening 许可证的客户激活。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioffea8b522f5f46ffa29d11c79c81c866__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">管理法律法规</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">激活要审查的凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">激活公司代码检查</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioffea8b522f5f46ffa29d11c79c81c866__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">支持国际贸易合规性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">保持国际贸易流程顺畅</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">避免财务损失</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "name_zh": "使用 SAP Watch List Screening 的受限制方审查 (1WE)",
